div.p:
You think. Why, you are a mercantile man, and this was a large transaction;
                    surely you must know well how the money was paid. Was it paid in money or by
                    cotton bonds?

The Lord Chief Justic.. Gentlemen, if you have
                    firmly and finally decided upon that point, it is, of course, useless to go on;
                    but that is the great point to which your attention is to be directed.
